ic motorcycle requires no engine oil changes, no fuel filters, and no spark plugs, significantly reducing annual maintenance costs compared to petrol alternatives. Enzi Motors maintains two showrooms and a dedicated service centre in Nairobi, with local spare parts availability and an in-house engineering team. The Enzi G5 electric mot11-50135000002025-10-14Corporate RoundKula Causeske
