ATF Greens LtdKenyahttps://atfgreens.comatfgreens.com2017AgricultureNairobiNairobi, Nairobi Area, KenyaATF Greens Ltd is a Kenyan agriculture company supplying sustainably grown fruits and vegetables to local and international markets.ATF Greens Ltd is a high-growth Kenyan agribusiness transforming commercial horticulture through sustainable production and value-added supply of premium fruits, vegetables, and culinary herbs for local and global markets. Headquartered in Isinya, Kenya, the company leverages modern greenhouse technology, efficient cold-chain logistics, and strong quality assurance systems to serve hotels, hospitals, schools, restaurants, supermarkets, and institutional buyers across East Africa, Europe, and the Middle East. Founded on principles of environmental stewardship and innovation, ATF Greens Ltd integrates solar-powered irrigation, precision farming, and post-harvest processing to maximize yields, reduce waste, and deliver consistently high-quality produce. The company’s vertically integrated model—from cultivation to export-ready packing—enhances margin control and supply reliability in markets demanding premium standards. With a scalable infrastructure footprint and growing export pipelines, ATF Greens Ltd is positioned to capitalize on rising global demand for healthy, traceable, and sustainably grown produce. The company is actively seeking strategic capital partnerships to expand processing facilities, enhance product diversification (including pre-cut and ready-to-use fresh produce), and accelerate market penetration internationally.101-250110000002017-04-17Seedke
